 iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetAMFI.cpp                                   optional iokitcpp
 iokit/Kernel/arm/RedwoodWLAN.cpp                                 optional iokitcpp
+iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetBTNub.cpp                                  optional iokitcpp
 iokit/Kernel/arm/MiniIONetworkStack.cpp                          optional iokitcpp
 iokit/Kernel/arm/hid/SweetHID.cpp                                optional iokitcpp
 iokit/Kernel/arm/hid/IOHIDEvent.cpp                              optional iokitcpp
